  {
    "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit002",
    "text": "傳子曰畿漢御史大夫杜延年之後延年父周自南陽徙茂陵延年徙杜陵子孫世居焉",
    "source_layer": "witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note",
    "mention_ids": [
