  {
    "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit005",
    "text": "太祖以畿為司空司直遷䕶羌校尉使持節領西平太守",
    "source_layer": "received_chapter",
    "mention_ids": [
      "c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit005:m0000",
